{"hookSpecificOutput": {"hookEventName": "PreToolUse", "permissionDecision": "deny", "permissionDecisionReason": "dangerous-ops-guard [data-destroy]: git clean with force and directory flags deletes every untracked file. Run it with -n first, or name the paths. [command-sha256:e377142493c70568d48201c6e94f6dc2e51f35dadded0c521d3e2806853ba9b1] If you truly intend this, run it in a shell outside the harness, or update harness/hooks/lib/dangerous_ops_guard.py to exempt the pattern."}}
